     "type": "key",
     "style": "methode",
     "title": "Sorting and queries",
     "md": "**Sorting** puts records in order, e.g. by Surname from A to Z or by Age from largest to smallest. A **search** or **query** finds records that match a condition, for example Town = \"Buea\". Conditions can be joined with AND / OR."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Mistakes",
     "md": "- Do not use a name as the primary key.\n- Keep one kind of data per field (do not mix first and last name in the same field if you want to sort by surname).\n- Back up the database regularly."
    },
